# Harness output, regenerated on every run.
#
# These screenshots are what the scripts produce while measuring, not what they
# measure. Tracking them made every test run dirty the worktree with binary
# diffs — and a worktree that is always dirty is a worktree whose real changes
# nobody notices.
harness/*.png
_probe.html

# What `frontend/.gitignore` gave this tree while it lived under `frontend/`.
# The repo-root .gitignore ignores `*.ts` (transport streams, for the Python
# engine): without the negation every TypeScript source here is ignored, and
# Tailwind, which honours ignore files, stops scanning them.
!*.ts

# Logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# Dependencies, build output, coverage
node_modules/
dist/
dist-ssr/
coverage/
*.tsbuildinfo

# Local / editor
*.local
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea/
.DS_Store
